00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:19,780
I bought you and Bernadette a gravy boat worth $88.

265
00:13:20,810 --> 00:13:22,940
Which places me in your debt

266
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:24,910
and I can't be in your debt

267
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:28,010
because someday you might ask me to help you move...

268
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:32,570
...or to kill a man.

269
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:35,990
I doubt he'll ask you to kill a man.

270
00:13:35,990 --> 00:13:37,430
Well, what if it's his only way out?

271
00:13:37,430 --> 00:13:38,430
I can't risk it.

272
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:41,850
Here is $12.

273
00:13:44,850 --> 00:13:46,070
Now, we're even.

274
00:13:46,070 --> 00:13:47,790
Wait...

275
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:49,910
I bought a card. Give me two dollars.

276
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:56,100
And for the record, this is why I hate gift-giving.

277
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:01,800
Who is it?

278
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,250
It's the groom.

279
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:06,620
You can't come in. Bad luck to see the bride.

280
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:10,240
Okay, uh, fine.

281
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,660
Bernie, I have to go pick up my mother!

282
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:14,280
I'll be right back!

283
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:16,560
Why can't she drive herself?!

284
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,440
She doesn't want to sit in her dress and wrinkle it

285
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:23,630
so I'm going to lay her down in the back of my neighbor's van!

286
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:26,230
All right, just hurry!

287
00:14:26,230 --> 00:14:28,700
Okay, I'll see you later, Ma... uh...

288
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:30,460
lovely bride-to-be.

289
00:14:32,330 --> 00:14:34,060
I really got to watch that.

290
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:42,310
Come on, Raj, we're ready to start.

291
00:14:42,310 --> 00:14:43,780
What, we're ready,

292
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:46,100
when I say we're ready.

293
00:14:50,070 --> 00:14:52,870
Okay, now we're ready.

294
00:14:53,550 --> 00:14:57,150
Ma, you want to move your chair over here so you can see?!

295
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:58,940
I'm fine where I am!

296
00:14:58,940 --> 00:15:01,180
I don't want to fall off the roof!

297
00:15:03,570 --> 00:15:05,880
You'll fall through the roof before you fall off it.

298
00:15:08,640 --> 00:15:09,580
Penny.

299
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:17,700
Your new mother-in-law's a piece of work.

300
00:15:18,300 --> 00:15:20,120
Not now, Dad.

301
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:23,020
She's got a bigger mustache than me.

302
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:26,650
Here you go.

303
00:15:28,370 --> 00:15:31,140
"Here you go"? What am I, a football?

304
00:15:38,350 --> 00:15:41,170
Like that guy could catch a football.

305
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,740
Howard and Bernadette,

306
00:15:44,740 --> 00:15:47,540
the five of us stand before you as your friends

307
00:15:47,540 --> 00:15:49,730
and newly ordained ministers.

308
00:15:49,730 --> 00:15:51,400
Louder!

309
00:15:53,230 --> 00:15:56,300
They all got ordained, they're all marrying us,

310
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:57,270
it's adorable!

311
00:15:57,270 --> 00:15:59,760
If you want to hear it, come closer!

312
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:05,420
Guys, when I look at the two of you

313
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:10,290
starting your lives together, it fills... my heart...

314
00:16:11,890 --> 00:16:14,240
It fills my... heart...

315
00:16:14,650 --> 00:16:16,570
Okay, I'm going to need a minute.

316
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:19,510
Okay, I'll, I'll go.

317
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:22,000
Howard and Bernadette, I know you two

318
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,760
planned on getting married in a big fancy wedding,

319
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,820
but when you're in love,

320
00:16:25,820 --> 00:16:28,680
it doesn't matter where or how these things happen.

321
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:31,350
It just matters that you have each other.

322
00:16:36,050 --> 00:16:37,360
Problem?

323
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:40,300
No.

324
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:44,450
I think the Reverend Hofstadter is making an ironic connection

325
00:16:44,450 --> 00:16:47,650
between your statement about love and your rejection

326
00:16:47,650 --> 00:16:49,680
of his proposal in the bedroom.

327
00:16:49,990 --> 00:16:52,120
- Oh, grow up. - Hey, I didn't say it.

328
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,080
All right, that's enough from the both of you.

329
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:53,910
Well, he started it!

330
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,140
Well, I'm ending it!

331
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:01,960
Bernadette, I want to thank you

332
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:04,100
for allowing me to be your maid of honor.

333
00:17:04,530 --> 00:17:06,160
I also want you to know,

334
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,990
that I will be happy to do it again

335
00:17:07,990 --> 00:17:09,920
if this marriage craps out.

336
00:17:16,230 --> 00:17:17,730
Thank you, Amy.

337
00:17:17,730 --> 00:17:19,550
Very touching.

338
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,190
Howard and Bernadette,

339
00:17:23,190 --> 00:17:26,610
you are lucky enough to be best friends who love each other.

340
00:17:26,610 --> 00:17:28,950
And that's the strongest kind of love

341
00:17:28,950 --> 00:17:32,580
because at its core, it has kindness,

342
00:17:32,580 --> 00:17:34,110
patience, and respect.

343
00:17:34,870 --> 00:17:39,100
Qualities that are hard to find in people these days.

344
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:46,360
Would you like some aloe vera?

345
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:48,470
You just got burned.

346
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:53,200
All right, my turn.

347
00:17:53,710 --> 00:17:56,790
Howard, Bernadette...

348
00:18:00,710 --> 00:18:03,410
Sheldon! I told you no Klingon!

349
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:09,380
Fine, I'll do it in English,

350
00:18:09,380 --> 00:18:11,170
but it loses something.

351
00:18:12,830 --> 00:18:15,200
The need to find another human being

352
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,980
to share one's life with,

353
00:18:16,980 --> 00:18:18,870
has always puzzled me.

354
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:23,570
Maybe because I'm so interesting all by myself.

355
00:18:25,410 --> 00:18:28,500
With that being said, may you find as much happiness

356
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:31,680
with each other as I find on my own.

357
00:18:32,700 --> 00:18:34,820
The Klingon would have made you cry.

358
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:39,860
I believe you two have prepared vows?

359
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:45,540
Howard Joel Wolowitz,

360
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:48,860
like you, this is going to be short and sweet.

361
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:52,870
I love you with all my heart and soul

362
00:18:52,870 --> 00:18:55,320
and promise to be with you forever.

363
00:19:00,670 --> 00:19:03,910
Bernadette Maryann Rostenkowski...

364
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:05,550
Speak up!

365
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:06,590
Hey, from now on,

366
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:08,730
she's the only women who can yell at me!

367
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,510
Until I met you,

368
00:19:15,510 --> 00:19:17,330
I couldn't imagine

369
00:19:17,330 --> 00:19:20,620
spending my life with just one person...

370
00:19:21,570 --> 00:19:24,760
...and now I can't imagine

371
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:27,550
spending one day of it without you.

372
00:19:30,190 --> 00:19:34,280
By the power vested in us, by the state of California...

373
00:19:34,280 --> 00:19:36,130
and the Klingon High Council...

374
00:19:38,670 --> 00:19:42,290
...we now pronounce you husband and wife.

375
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:04,810
That's ignition.

376
00:20:04,810 --> 00:20:06,680
I love this part!

377
00:20:06,890 --> 00:20:08,310
Me, too!

378
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:11,430
I have strongly mixed feelings!

379
00:20:14,250 --> 00:20:16,100
Oh, my God, it's happening.

380
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:17,150
Did I miss it?

381
00:20:17,150 --> 00:20:18,720
No, come on in. Hurry.

382
00:20:21,050 --> 00:20:22,820
I love that man.

383
00:20:23,350 --> 00:20:25,350
Me, too.

384
00:20:29,910 --> 00:20:31,300
I can't believe it.

385
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:34,860
This whole time, a small part of me thought he was lying.

386
00:20:40,390 --> 00:20:41,730
This is it.

387
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:45,100
Boldly go, Howard Wolowitz.

388
00:20:50,490 --> 00:20:52,700
NOy vay...!

